  "description": "Experience enhanced truck accessibility with OEDRO Heavy-Duty Triple-Step Running Boards. Designed with three raised stepping zones, a wide triple-convex platform, and reinforced carbon steel structure, these side steps provide stable entry, convenient bed access, strong 550 lbs support, and durable protection against harsh road conditions, rocks, and debris.\nFeatures\nTriple-Raised Step Design for Maximum Accessibility: Featuring an extended three-step raised platform, these running boards provide multiple access points for easier entry, windshield cleaning, roof loading, and truck bed access, making everyday use more convenient.\nTriple-Convex Platform for Secure Stepping: The unique triple-convex step design creates a wider and more ergonomic stepping surface, improving comfort and stability while getting in and out of the vehicle.\nHeavy-Duty Carbon Steel Construction with 550 lbs Capacity: Built from reinforced carbon steel with a durable powder-coated finish, these side steps deliver excellent strength, corrosion resistance, and support up to 550 lbs per side without bending or flexing.\n6.8\" Angular Design with Enhanced Side Protection: The rugged wide-body structure provides an aggressive off-road appearance while helping protect the lower vehicle body from rocks, debris, and trail hazards.\nBolt-On Installation with Reinforced Brackets: Designed for a straightforward upgrade with no drilling required, the direct bolt-on system and welded brackets provide secure mounting, simplified installation, and long-lasting durability.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 RAM 1500 Crew Cab",
  "highlights": [
    "Built with high-strength carbon steel and a reinforced triangular structure, OEDRO running boards deliver exceptional durability and stability. The rugged powder-coated finish helps resist rust, corrosion, and daily wear, providing reliable performance in demanding environments.",
    "The innovative three-raised step layout provides multiple stepping positions for easier access to the cabin, truck bed, and roof area. Whether loading cargo, reaching equipment, or preparing for outdoor adventures, the extended step design improves overall accessibility.",
    "Featuring a 6.8-inch wide step surface with a perforated anti-slip pattern, these side steps offer secure footing while allowing water, mud, dirt, and snow to drain quickly. Designed for all-weather use, they enhance safety and confidence during every journey."
  ],
